WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:20.876
"That's not true, Jeb," said Poppy.

2
00:00:20.877 --> 00:00:23.463
"You're good at things."

3
00:00:23.464 --> 00:00:27.625
"Not like you, Poppy," said Jeb.

4
00:00:27.626 --> 00:00:31.072
"You're funny.

5
00:00:31.073 --> 00:00:35.334
Eddy is fast.

6
00:00:35.335 --> 00:00:39.189
And Dipper plays music."

7
00:00:39.190 --> 00:00:43.470
"You're good at digging dirt," said Dipper.

8
00:00:43.471 --> 00:00:46.754
"I guess," said Jeb.

9
00:00:46.755 --> 00:00:50.550
"But no one cares about digging."

10
00:00:50.551 --> 00:00:53.706
"I do!" said Eddy.

11
00:00:53.707 --> 00:01:00.271
"Dirt is fun!"

12
00:01:00.272 --> 00:01:05.510
Just then a snowflake fell.

13
00:01:05.511 --> 00:01:13.153
"It's starting to snow!" said Poppy.

14
00:01:13.154 --> 00:01:16.702
More snowflakes fell.

15
00:01:16.703 --> 00:01:21.771
"Yay!" cried Poppy.

16
00:01:21.772 --> 00:01:28.649
Eddy stuck out his tongue.

17
00:01:28.650 --> 00:01:31.267
He caught a snowflake.

18
00:01:31.268 --> 00:01:34.680
"Mmm!" said Eddy.

19
00:01:34.681 --> 00:01:40.783
Soon snow covered the ground.

20
00:01:40.784 --> 00:01:49.675
The snow got deep.

21
00:01:49.676 --> 00:01:53.985
"We're going home early!" said Mr. Grill.

22
00:01:53.986 --> 00:02:04.723
"Yay!" shouted the students.

23
00:02:04.724 --> 00:02:08.323
Poppy's tires spun in the snow.

24
00:02:08.324 --> 00:02:10.934
She didn't move.

25
00:02:10.935 --> 00:02:16.618
"Uh-oh!" said Poppy.
